WEBVTT

00:07.380 --> 00:08.380
[Takemichi] <i>Huh?</i>

00:09.250 --> 00:11.340
<i>Inupi and Koko?</i>

00:11.920 --> 00:14.050
<i>What are these two doing here?</i>

00:15.720 --> 00:17.930
Did you know, Hanagaki?

00:18.560 --> 00:19.890
[grunts]

00:19.970 --> 00:21.140
Huh?

00:21.220 --> 00:25.060
We, the Fifth Division,
have a special role in Toman.

00:25.850 --> 00:28.980
We're a special team,
the only one allowed to do infighting.

00:29.070 --> 00:30.070
Huh?

00:30.730 --> 00:32.940
[Takemichi]
<i>They're allowed to do infighting?</i>

00:33.610 --> 00:35.490
[Mucho] That fight betting...

00:36.280 --> 00:38.990
Remember when Kiyomasa
was just about to kill you?

00:39.080 --> 00:42.580
I bet you've never thought
why Mikey and Draken showed up

00:42.660 --> 00:44.160
at just the right time.

00:44.250 --> 00:45.580
Huh?

00:45.670 --> 00:48.130
[Mucho] We're the reason why.

00:48.840 --> 00:51.920
Whenever there's a traitor,
I inform the leader.

00:52.010 --> 00:53.090
In some cases,

00:53.550 --> 00:57.180
it's even okay if I report it
after we've punished them.

00:58.390 --> 01:05.190
I'm the best fighter among the captains,
so Mikey gave me this special position.

01:05.270 --> 01:06.640
[gasps]

01:06.730 --> 01:07.850
[Takemichi] <i>A special team?</i>

01:08.810 --> 01:11.730
<i>So Mucho is a good guy
who's working to help Toman?</i>

01:12.820 --> 01:15.700
<i>Does that mean I'm a bad guy?</i>

01:16.700 --> 01:17.780
[Mucho] Hm.

01:18.660 --> 01:21.580
[Takemichi]
<i>Am I suspected of doing something?</i>

01:23.580 --> 01:25.580
[♪ theme music]

03:04.390 --> 03:05.760
TO SHINICHIRO SANO

03:05.850 --> 03:07.430
[gasps]

03:08.680 --> 03:11.190
[Emma's mother]
Emma, say bye to your big brother.

03:12.060 --> 03:13.060
Huh?

03:18.650 --> 03:19.650
This is goodbye.

03:21.530 --> 03:23.660
I'm going to a foster home.

03:23.740 --> 03:25.200
A foster home?

03:25.700 --> 03:27.080
Is that a fun place?

03:27.160 --> 03:29.540
[chuckles]
Yeah, I'm sure it'll be fun.

03:29.620 --> 03:31.830
Really? You're lucky!

03:31.920 --> 03:33.250
I want to go too!

03:33.330 --> 03:35.340
[chuckles]

03:42.300 --> 03:44.760
I'll come back for you someday.

03:44.840 --> 03:46.300
Huh?

03:46.390 --> 03:48.510
[Izana] I promise, Emma.

03:51.270 --> 03:54.150
My other big brother...

04:00.150 --> 04:02.450
[Mucho] My motto is

04:03.240 --> 04:05.570
"Punish the suspicious."

04:05.660 --> 04:06.660
What?

04:06.740 --> 04:08.410
Hold on a sec here!

04:08.490 --> 04:10.330
What do you think I did?

04:10.410 --> 04:13.370
You think I've done something, don't you?

04:13.870 --> 04:14.870
What?

04:14.960 --> 04:15.960
Huh?

04:18.670 --> 04:19.960
It's Izana, isn't it?

04:20.050 --> 04:21.050
Huh?

04:22.630 --> 04:25.260
It's because
Tenjiku's Izana Kurokawa and I

04:25.720 --> 04:27.680
have a history.

04:29.470 --> 04:30.640
[Takemichi] <i>What's he talking about?</i>

04:33.140 --> 04:34.310
EIGHTH GENERATION BLACK DRAGON

04:34.390 --> 04:35.520
[Inui] <i>I used to be in</i>

04:35.600 --> 04:37.980
<i>the eighth generation BLACK DRAGON.</i>

04:38.980 --> 04:43.360
I was a close aide to Izana,
and now I'm in Toman's First Division.

04:45.410 --> 04:48.120
"First Division ratted us out."

04:48.620 --> 04:50.160
"Tenjiku's spy."

04:50.240 --> 04:51.240
Huh?

04:51.330 --> 04:53.160
"And the mastermind is

04:53.250 --> 04:55.670
the one who brought us in,
Takemichi Hanagaki."

04:55.750 --> 04:56.750
[gasps]

04:56.830 --> 04:57.880
No way!

04:57.960 --> 05:01.090
I bet that's what you're thinking,
isn't it, Mucho?

05:01.170 --> 05:02.880
[Takemichi gasps]

05:05.590 --> 05:07.340
"Ratted us out"?

05:08.180 --> 05:10.560
I'm the traitor in Toman?

05:11.680 --> 05:12.890
[Takemichi] <i>Wait!</i>

05:12.970 --> 05:15.180
<i>Is this guy</i>

05:15.770 --> 05:17.100
<i>framing me?</i>

05:19.940 --> 05:21.690
No! I...

05:22.320 --> 05:25.240
<i>Oh no! I can't think of an explanation.</i>

05:26.530 --> 05:28.240
Hanagaki didn't rat Toman out.

05:28.320 --> 05:29.370
Huh?

05:29.950 --> 05:30.950
[Mucho] Hm?

05:31.030 --> 05:33.870
Mucho, you've got it wrong.

05:34.870 --> 05:39.630
Neither Hanagaki nor me nor Koko
have done anything to betray Toman.

05:39.710 --> 05:40.710
[Mucho grunts]

05:41.670 --> 05:43.670
Prepare to get on your knees and beg.

05:44.760 --> 05:45.970
Huh?

05:46.050 --> 05:48.380
[Takemichi] <i>What? What's going on?</i>

05:48.890 --> 05:50.180
[snickers]

05:50.260 --> 05:52.890
I think you morons don't get the picture.

05:54.520 --> 05:58.600
I told you about my special role
because this isn't part of it.

05:58.690 --> 05:59.690
[Takemichi] Huh?

05:59.770 --> 06:00.980
It's not?

06:01.360 --> 06:02.570
Then what's this about?

06:02.940 --> 06:04.900
They're making their move.

06:06.400 --> 06:09.320
The ghosts of S-62.

06:10.370 --> 06:12.200
S-62?

06:12.990 --> 06:14.410
[Takemichi] <i>The Vicious Generation?</i>

06:14.870 --> 06:17.250
<i>Those Tenjiku guys
who attacked us by surprise?</i>

06:17.750 --> 06:19.830
So that's what this is about?

06:20.380 --> 06:23.000
What is? What's this about?

06:23.090 --> 06:24.840
Yasuhiro Muto here,

06:25.460 --> 06:28.470
he used to be pals
with Izana Kurokawa and them.

06:28.550 --> 06:29.840
[gasps]

06:30.340 --> 06:35.810
[Inui] He's one of the Vicious Generation,
the six guys who met in reform school.

06:36.470 --> 06:38.310
-One, two. One, two...
-One, two. One, two...

06:38.390 --> 06:44.570
-One, two. One, two...
-One, two. One, two...

06:45.230 --> 06:48.110
[Takemichi] <i>Mucho is part
of the Vicious Generation,</i>

06:48.190 --> 06:49.530
<i>just like Izana Kurokawa?</i>

06:51.280 --> 06:53.410
<i>He's pals with Izana Kurokawa?</i>

06:54.280 --> 06:57.700
Once Izana came back into power,
my path was decided.

06:57.790 --> 06:59.620
[gasps in surprise]

07:00.160 --> 07:02.130
In those days, we ruled.

07:02.540 --> 07:04.590
It's time to bring them back.

07:04.670 --> 07:06.460
[breathes shakily]

07:07.340 --> 07:09.550
I think you get it, Hanagaki.

07:10.930 --> 07:14.640
I'm one of
the founding members of Tenjiku.

07:14.720 --> 07:15.930
[grunts]

07:16.470 --> 07:19.430
[Takemichi] <i>Now that I think about it,</i>

07:19.520 --> 07:23.230
<i>he was the only captain who wasn't
a victim of Tenjiku's surprise attack.</i>

07:25.060 --> 07:26.070
Takemichi.

07:27.150 --> 07:29.570
Beware of a traitor.

07:30.150 --> 07:31.280
[grunts]

07:32.030 --> 07:34.410
[Takemichi]
<i>He's the traitor that Kaku-chan meant.</i>

07:36.120 --> 07:40.460
<i>And while Tenjiku was attacking Toman,
Mucho grabbed these two.</i>

07:41.580 --> 07:42.920
Mucho,

07:43.500 --> 07:46.960
does this mean you're betraying Mikey?
You're betraying Toman?

07:51.220 --> 07:52.430
[sighs]

07:53.220 --> 07:57.430
If only I'd met Mikey earlier,
things may have been different.

07:59.390 --> 08:01.810
Now that Izana's a leader again,

08:03.060 --> 08:04.650
you're all my enemies.

08:05.650 --> 08:07.150
This is where you die.

08:07.230 --> 08:10.280
[gasps]
What the hell are you after?

08:10.650 --> 08:12.900
No matter how devoted you are
to Izana Kurokawa,

08:12.990 --> 08:15.070
all he cares about is Mikey.

08:15.570 --> 08:19.240
He only formed Tenjiku
so he could crush Mikey.

08:20.160 --> 08:22.460
I don't care what Izana's plans are.

08:22.540 --> 08:23.660
Huh?

08:24.120 --> 08:29.170
The gang Tenjiku exists,
and Izana is the leader of it.

08:29.250 --> 08:30.630
That's all that matters.

08:31.050 --> 08:32.880
[Takemichi] <i>Are you insane, Mucho?</i>

08:33.420 --> 08:36.590
Then it's the same with Mikey
being the leader of Toman!

08:36.680 --> 08:38.970
That's not what it's about, Hanagaki.

08:39.060 --> 08:40.470
[exhales deeply]

08:40.560 --> 08:43.430
There's a reason why I abducted you three.

08:45.520 --> 08:48.190
Seishu Inui and Hajime Kokonoi,

08:48.690 --> 08:51.400
why did you join Hanagaki's division?

08:51.480 --> 08:53.860
So you wouldn't get used again?

08:53.950 --> 08:55.070
Huh?

08:56.950 --> 08:58.820
The 10th leader of BLACK DRAGON,
Taiju Shiba,

08:58.910 --> 09:02.250
you followed him for the same reason,
didn't you?

09:03.290 --> 09:04.580
Inui.

09:04.660 --> 09:08.750
You used his power
in order to rebuild BLACK DRAGON.

09:08.830 --> 09:10.710
[exhales deeply]

09:10.800 --> 09:12.090
Then, in return,

09:12.170 --> 09:18.050
Taiju recruited Hajime Kokonoi
into BLACK DRAGON.

09:18.840 --> 09:20.350
[groans]

09:20.430 --> 09:22.220
[Takemichi] <i>Why Koko?</i>

09:22.810 --> 09:27.730
Do you know why Taiju wanted
Hajime Kokonoi, Hanagaki?

09:29.480 --> 09:32.980
Because Kokonoi is a genius
at making money.

09:34.360 --> 09:36.950
[Mucho] Izana wants
to make use of that power.

09:37.610 --> 09:38.910
Huh?

09:38.990 --> 09:43.040
[Takemichi] <i>What? It wasn't Taiju
who was good at bringing in money?</i>

09:45.660 --> 09:46.790
[gasps]

09:47.290 --> 09:49.790
Having a private meeting, huh?

09:49.880 --> 09:53.710
Are you still just
Toman's wallet, Kokonoi?

09:55.340 --> 09:56.590
[Takemichi] <i>Come to think of it,</i>

09:56.670 --> 09:59.090
<i>no matter which future it was,
Koko is in Toman.</i>

09:59.760 --> 10:01.430
<i>You mean Hajime Kokonoi is</i>

10:01.510 --> 10:04.640
<i>the guy who controls
Toman's finances in the future?</i>

10:06.390 --> 10:11.610
Unfortunately, the trouble with you,
Kokonoi, is you only listen to Inui.

10:11.690 --> 10:12.770
[sighs]

10:12.860 --> 10:17.150
What's more, for some reason,
Inui's working for Hanagaki now.

10:17.240 --> 10:20.410
That's why I'll kill Inui
and Hanagaki right here.

10:21.450 --> 10:24.080
With nobody left
for you to follow, Kokonoi,

10:24.660 --> 10:27.580
you've got no choice
but to join Tenjiku, right?

10:27.660 --> 10:30.040
What? That's totally insane!

10:31.540 --> 10:33.630
So, what'll it be, Kokonoi?

10:34.000 --> 10:36.300
Will you die here with these two?

10:37.050 --> 10:39.010
Or will you join Tenjiku?

10:39.800 --> 10:41.180
The choice is yours.

10:41.840 --> 10:43.220
[grunts]

10:44.100 --> 10:45.640
[scoffs]

10:46.470 --> 10:47.480
Hanagaki.

10:47.560 --> 10:49.100
[groans]

10:50.940 --> 10:53.310
Mikey's not the only one Izana's after.

10:53.900 --> 10:55.270
Kokonoi's money.

10:55.900 --> 10:57.230
[Mucho] <i>Kisaki's brains.</i>

10:57.320 --> 10:59.950
<i>And Mikey's charisma.</i>

11:00.030 --> 11:03.910
He wants to use them to build
the most powerful crime syndicate ever.

11:05.490 --> 11:07.620
[Takemichi]
<i>The most powerful crime syndicate?</i>

11:08.040 --> 11:11.670
<i>That's Kisaki's... The Toman
that Kisaki builds in the future.</i>

11:12.880 --> 11:16.800
Us members of S-62 Generation are now 18.

11:17.550 --> 11:21.340
We're not going to mess around
with kiddie stuff like biker gangs.

11:22.220 --> 11:23.220
Kokonoi.

11:23.300 --> 11:24.510
[grunts]

11:24.600 --> 11:29.730
If you join us,
we'll let Inui and Hanagaki go free.

11:29.810 --> 11:31.230
[grunts]

11:31.310 --> 11:33.940
What'll it be, Hajime Kokonoi?

11:35.020 --> 11:37.530
I... I...

11:39.490 --> 11:40.990
-[Takemichi] Koko.
-Huh?

11:41.490 --> 11:43.200
[groans]

11:43.280 --> 11:46.620
You don't have to do anything
this asshole says.

11:47.870 --> 11:49.080
Hanagaki...

11:49.160 --> 11:51.000
[grunting]

11:56.880 --> 11:58.960
[Takemichi] <i>This has been a losing battle.</i>

11:59.630 --> 12:01.720
<i>But I've finally found
a chance for victory.</i>

12:02.720 --> 12:06.180
<i>There's no way
I can let Tenjiku have Hajime Kokonoi.</i>

12:07.260 --> 12:08.310
Mucho,

12:09.060 --> 12:14.060
if you're really serious
about building a crime syndicate,

12:14.850 --> 12:18.520
then I won't back off
even if you're going to kill me.

12:19.070 --> 12:20.070
Huh?

12:20.570 --> 12:23.900
[Takemichi] <i>I never want to see Toman
end up like that again.</i>

12:25.070 --> 12:27.660
Hajime Kokonoi is a member
of the First Division.

12:29.370 --> 12:33.330
There's no way in hell
I'll let you bastards have one of my men!

12:33.410 --> 12:35.290
[groans]

12:36.000 --> 12:37.000
Hanagaki...

12:37.590 --> 12:39.000
[Takemichi] <i>I'll protect him.</i>

12:39.590 --> 12:41.340
<i>That's my chance for victory.</i>

12:42.380 --> 12:44.760
I'm suddenly all pumped up!

12:46.050 --> 12:49.430
TOKYO MANJI GANG

12:49.930 --> 12:52.810
I'm not handing Koko over
to you Tenjiku bastards.

12:53.680 --> 12:54.730
Hanagaki...

12:55.350 --> 12:57.060
What'll you do about it?

12:57.690 --> 12:59.690
You can't defeat me.

13:00.270 --> 13:02.530
You just don't get it, do you, Mucho?

13:03.110 --> 13:05.150
It's not about whether I can win or not!

13:05.240 --> 13:06.860
[breathes deeply]

13:07.660 --> 13:10.200
Is winning really that important?

13:10.280 --> 13:11.790
[gasps]

13:14.290 --> 13:17.040
[blows]

13:17.790 --> 13:19.500
I won't back off even if it kills me.

13:20.040 --> 13:21.460
Let's do this!

13:21.550 --> 13:24.170
[both grunt]

13:29.350 --> 13:31.810
[grunting]

13:35.020 --> 13:36.020
Damn...

13:36.480 --> 13:37.850
I swear...

13:38.480 --> 13:40.520
I swear I'll never back off!

13:46.280 --> 13:47.700
[groans]

13:48.860 --> 13:50.320
Ow...

13:51.490 --> 13:52.660
It stinks.

13:54.950 --> 13:56.370
[Takemichi] Inupi.

13:57.330 --> 13:58.620
Oh, right.

13:59.500 --> 14:01.380
I swear I'll never back off!

14:03.710 --> 14:05.590
[grunting]

14:07.130 --> 14:09.970
I'll back you up, Hanagaki!

14:10.050 --> 14:11.470
You goddamn maggots.

14:17.560 --> 14:18.940
[both groan]

14:19.020 --> 14:20.560
[grunts]

14:21.270 --> 14:23.270
[Mucho] What'll it be, Kokonoi?

14:23.360 --> 14:24.360
If I keep this up,

14:24.980 --> 14:27.150
these two are going to die.

14:30.110 --> 14:31.280
Fine, Mucho!

14:32.240 --> 14:33.740
I'll do whatever you ask.

14:35.080 --> 14:37.500
Just let them two go!

14:41.540 --> 14:42.630
[Inui] Hanagaki...

14:44.840 --> 14:45.880
Sorry...

14:46.840 --> 14:48.340
I wasn't any help.

14:50.720 --> 14:53.600
I couldn't... protect Koko.

14:54.600 --> 14:56.970
Don't you worry, Inupi.

15:00.060 --> 15:02.400
It's not like they'll kill Koko.

15:03.190 --> 15:05.570
They just want to use Koko

15:06.070 --> 15:08.820
so they can build
the vilest criminal syndicate around.

15:09.700 --> 15:10.780
Inupi,

15:11.320 --> 15:14.830
I had you two all wrong.

15:15.700 --> 15:20.210
I thought you were hopeless scumbags
like those Tenjiku bastards.

15:20.960 --> 15:23.790
But you backed me up.

15:24.920 --> 15:28.460
Koko sacrificed himself to save us.

15:29.840 --> 15:32.180
Both of you guys are good people.

15:34.470 --> 15:35.720
You're my friends.

15:35.800 --> 15:37.100
[gasps]

15:39.140 --> 15:41.560
[Takemichi] There's no way
I'll let Tenjiku have Koko.

15:42.060 --> 15:43.600
I swear I'll bring him back.

15:44.400 --> 15:46.820
So don't you worry, Inupi.

15:47.320 --> 15:48.650
[Inui] Bring him back?

15:49.230 --> 15:50.320
But how?

15:50.740 --> 15:53.200
Well... I'll figure it out.

15:54.620 --> 15:55.780
Seriously?

15:55.870 --> 15:57.490
I'll come up with an idea.

15:57.580 --> 15:59.040
[laughs]

15:59.120 --> 16:00.700
What are you laughing about?

16:00.790 --> 16:02.120
I'm serious, man!

16:02.580 --> 16:04.710
Let me down, Hanagaki.

16:07.130 --> 16:09.960
I can tell you don't believe me at all.

16:12.550 --> 16:13.550
Follow me.

16:18.510 --> 16:20.060
This is my and Koko's hideout.

16:20.930 --> 16:23.350
A hideout?
More like an abandoned building.

16:23.940 --> 16:24.980
Come in.

16:25.060 --> 16:26.860
We can patch ourselves up.

16:26.940 --> 16:29.190
Oh... Okay.

16:30.360 --> 16:31.690
[Takemichi] Ow...

16:34.860 --> 16:38.030
[Takemichi] <i>Is that... oil I smell?</i>

16:38.120 --> 16:39.950
[sighs]

16:43.910 --> 16:45.040
I...

16:46.710 --> 16:51.420
I want to revive BLACK DRAGON
with a specific goal in mind.

16:53.130 --> 16:54.220
Koko...

16:54.680 --> 16:57.390
He has stuck with me
through this whole thing.

16:58.350 --> 17:01.310
I'm totally worthless,
but he still supported me.

17:02.770 --> 17:06.440
I would die for Koko's sake.

17:09.820 --> 17:11.360
[breathes deeply]

17:15.780 --> 17:17.780
I'm putting my life in your hands.

17:20.160 --> 17:23.000
Please carry on BLACK DRAGON, Hanagaki.

17:23.950 --> 17:27.880
Please become the 11th leader
of BLACK DRAGON!

17:27.960 --> 17:28.960
Huh?

17:31.380 --> 17:33.710
Hanagaki, save Koko.

17:35.800 --> 17:37.470
Please, save us.

17:44.810 --> 17:46.230
[sighs deeply]

17:47.230 --> 17:48.770
Sorry, Hanagaki.

17:49.980 --> 17:52.650
I must be losing my mind.

18:06.750 --> 18:11.750
This used to be Shinichiro's bike shop.

18:11.840 --> 18:14.170
Huh? Shinichiro?

18:15.010 --> 18:16.760
You mean Mikey's brother?

18:16.840 --> 18:17.930
Yeah.

18:21.300 --> 18:22.350
This was the place...

18:25.970 --> 18:30.560
To hoodlums like me,
this was a place for us to gather.

18:31.900 --> 18:33.730
It's nothing like it was back then.

18:35.400 --> 18:36.690
Over there,

18:36.780 --> 18:41.120
there was a line of shiny, badass bikes.

18:42.120 --> 18:46.040
Shinichiro would always be
sitting back there working on a bike.

18:47.960 --> 18:49.870
<i>He'd have a cigarette in his mouth too.</i>

18:51.460 --> 18:53.840
Even with all that oil and gas around.

18:55.460 --> 19:00.340
<i>All my seniors who would stop by
looked so awesome and cool.</i>

19:01.180 --> 19:06.310
<i>But even those guys were
on their best behavior around Shinichiro.</i>

19:08.520 --> 19:10.060
<i>He was my hero.</i>

19:12.270 --> 19:16.570
Is that the reason why you've got
such an attachment to BLACK DRAGON?

19:17.400 --> 19:21.360
I want to recreate the first generation
BLACK DRAGON Shinichiro built.

19:22.450 --> 19:23.620
In this bike shop,

19:24.120 --> 19:27.870
I heard a lot of stories about that time
from first-generation guys.

19:29.620 --> 19:32.040
They had so much fun talking

19:33.210 --> 19:35.290
about their old leader, Shinichiro.

19:36.040 --> 19:39.340
<i>At those times,
Shinichiro would always say...</i>

19:40.470 --> 19:42.470
Did we really do that?

19:42.890 --> 19:45.600
He said it all awkward and bashful.

19:47.390 --> 19:48.720
Sounds nice, doesn't it?

19:50.270 --> 19:54.690
Friends to laugh at dumb stuff
you'd done together, even as adults...

19:55.480 --> 19:57.190
I admired that kind of gang.

19:58.690 --> 20:00.570
That's why I joined BLACK DRAGON.

20:03.530 --> 20:06.660
It was the eighth generation BLACK DRAGON
when I joined,

20:07.120 --> 20:08.910
when Izana Kurokawa was in charge.

20:08.990 --> 20:10.830
EIGHTH GENERATION BLACK DRAGON

20:10.910 --> 20:12.660
[Izana] Even though
you're two years younger,

20:12.750 --> 20:16.080
I made you my aide because you're useful.

20:17.840 --> 20:19.460
Support the ninth-generation leader too.

20:21.220 --> 20:22.220
Yes, sir.

20:24.510 --> 20:26.970
From the eighth-generation BLACK DRAGON,

20:27.050 --> 20:29.430
we became a vicious gang
where anything goes,

20:29.810 --> 20:32.640
like extortion, theft, and drugs.

20:33.100 --> 20:35.600
[Inui] <i>The members
of the Vicious Generation</i>

20:36.520 --> 20:39.520
<i>were ramping around in each territory
as if they were competing.</i>

20:40.320 --> 20:41.530
<i>And then there he was...</i>

20:41.610 --> 20:44.110
<i>The BLACK DRAGON that Izana led</i>

20:44.200 --> 20:47.700
<i>didn't have a trace
of the goals of the original gang.</i>

20:49.120 --> 20:53.160
And before I knew it,
I'd been influenced by that gang.

20:53.750 --> 20:54.920
I was sent to juvie,

20:55.540 --> 20:58.590
and when I got out,
BLACK DRAGON had been crushed.

21:00.250 --> 21:01.300
I was afraid.

21:01.800 --> 21:04.130
I thought BLACK DRAGON
would come to an end.

21:04.800 --> 21:07.840
So I turned to Taiju Shiba.

21:11.140 --> 21:13.230
You know how the rest goes.

21:14.770 --> 21:18.190
What was I even doing?

21:18.690 --> 21:20.020
Inupi...

21:23.780 --> 21:26.910
There's somebody I want to save.

21:29.910 --> 21:32.160
I've done all I can to do that.

21:33.200 --> 21:35.410
But I haven't succeeded at all.

21:35.960 --> 21:37.620
I wonder what the heck I'm doing.

21:37.710 --> 21:39.080
[soft grunt]

21:40.290 --> 21:41.300
But...

21:44.050 --> 21:45.050
that's why

21:45.840 --> 21:48.800
I understand how you feel, Inupi.

21:48.890 --> 21:50.350
Huh.

21:51.810 --> 21:53.770
I will carry on BLACK DRAGON.

21:53.850 --> 21:54.980
Eh?

21:55.480 --> 21:58.690
I'll be captain
of Tokyo Manji Gang's First Division

21:59.150 --> 22:01.440
and the 11th leader of BLACK DRAGON.

22:03.730 --> 22:04.990
I hope you're prepared.

22:07.320 --> 22:09.910
I'll bring Koko back

22:10.740 --> 22:12.410
and destroy Kisaki and Izana.

22:14.700 --> 22:16.160
I'll crush Tenjiku!

22:17.080 --> 22:18.830
Huh?

22:19.880 --> 22:21.210
Are you with me?

22:31.350 --> 22:34.510
My life is in your hands.

22:40.560 --> 22:42.610
[♪ closing theme music]

23:44.840 --> 23:46.960
Translated by Brian Athey
